from their registries and builds Echo's own images on your machine. Whoever publishes an image built from this repository (for
example to a container registry) redistributes the material below and has to comply with each license for it.

Licenses below are the ones in the LICENSE file of the upstream source repository at the tag that the Compose file uses, read on
2026-11-25. They are the license of the project; the image of a project also carries other software (operating system packages,
Postgres extensions, libraries), each under its own license, which was NOT inventoried one by one.

