|---|---|---|
| public.ecr.aws/supabase/postgres:17.6.1.095 (base of the `db` image) | supabase/postgres | PostgreSQL License. The image bundles Postgres, pg_cron, pg_net, supabase_vault, pgsodium and other extensions, each under its own license (PostgreSQL, Apache-2.0, MIT and others) |
| public.ecr.aws/supabase/gotrue:v2.198.0 | supabase/auth | MIT |
| public.ecr.aws/supabase/storage-api:v1.98.5 | supabase/storage | Apache-2.0 |
| public.ecr.aws/supabase/realtime:v2.174.5 | supabase/realtime | Apache-2.0 |
| public.ecr.aws/supabase/postgrest:v14.3 | PostgREST/postgrest | MIT |
| caddy:2.10.2-alpine (base of the `gateway` image) | caddyserver/caddy | Apache-2.0 (also the `org.opencontainers.image.licenses` label of the image) |
| node:22.22.3-alpine3.24 (build stage of the front end and base of the QR service image) | nodejs/node, Alpine Linux | Node.js: MIT. Alpine and its packages: several licenses, see qr-service/NOTICE |
| denoland/deno:alpine-2.5.6 (base of the `functions` image) | denoland/deno | MIT |
