Packages the function runtime downloads at build time (pinned in docker/functions/deno.lock), besides the ones in
supabase/functions/: nodemailer 10.3.1 (MIT-0, `npm:` specifier, loaded only when SMTP is configured) and unpdf 0.12.1 (MIT, `npm:` through
the import map, used to read PDFs; its optional canvas dependency is downloaded with its npm dependencies but never loaded). web-push 3.6.7 is MPL-2.0, listed above. The QR service image installs ffmpeg and tini from the Alpine
